subsection.subsection:
A county auditor who receives a copy of an application in accordance with Subsection (8)(a) shall provide a copy of the application to the county:
assessor;
attorney;
legislative body; and
treasurer.

Upon request, the commission shall provide to a nonprofit organization that represents counties in the state the following information regarding an appeal filed under this section:
the name of the property owner filing the appeal;
each year at issue in the appeal;
the value assessed by the commission for the property that is the subject of the appeal; and
the owner's estimate of value for the property that is the subject of the appeal as submitted under Subsection (5)(b).
